```Title: AWS Bedrock Model Access Requested or Enabled (AWS CloudTrail)```
```ATT&CK: T1496.004 | Severity: medium | Sigma id: d3086da2-f172-4b15-af44-cd0e44c21020```
```Data source: AWS CloudTrail (Splunk Add-on for AWS). Change index to where your CloudTrail data lives.```
```False positives: Administrators enabling Bedrock models for approved projects```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity medium.```
index=aws sourcetype="aws:cloudtrail"
(eventSource="bedrock.amazonaws.com" eventName IN ("PutUseCaseForModelAccess", "CreateFoundationModelAgreement", "PutFoundationModelEntitlement"))
| table _time eventSource eventName userIdentity.arn sourceIPAddress awsRegion errorCode
